    "title": "Purdue basketball vs Texas March Madness Sweet 16 live updates",
    "text": "BASKETBALLPurdue vs Texas live updates, odds and bracket predictions Sam KingLafayette Journal & CourierMarch 24, 2026Updated March 28, 2026, 7:18 p.m. ETSAN JOSE, Calif. — Purdue basketball will play in its seventh Sweet 16 in the past nine NCAA Tournaments this week against an unexpected 2026 March Madness darling.The No. 2 Boilermakers (29-8) are at SAP Center in California to face No. 11 Texas (21-14) in a West Regional semifinal. Purdue waltzed through its first two rounds by double digits, while Texas had to play its way out of the First Four before knocking out two teams picked by many to still be alive in the Sweet 16.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
